' Party cycling by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30 party`:
' the leader and one companion handed over, a prepared state). In a place, in
' group mode: Shift+Right selects the companion alone, Shift+Right again the
' leader alone, Shift+Left the companion (single mode goes round), and a
' click then walks only him: between the two saves the leader stays at
' 64,160 and the companion goes from 63,147 to 148,148 (Classic). On the world
' map the same keys go on from the selection (`CyclePartyCharacter`,
' MapScene.cs:522-563): the companion is still selected, alone, so
' Shift+Right takes the leader and again the companion; the map announces
' no name (the log's `selected` lines only).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press shift+right        ' the companion, alone
press shift+right        ' the leader, alone
press shift+left         ' the companion again
save                     ' where both stand
mapclick 150,150         ' only he walks
wait 60
save                     ' he has moved, the leader has not
esc                      ' the world map
wait 10
press shift+right        ' from the companion: the leader
press shift+right        ' and the companion again
quit
